program	const_generic_bad_value_type_error.saw
triple	arm64-apple-darwin
twin	same
expect	error
build	refused	a const parameter is `Int` or `UInt`, and `Name` is declared `String`
meets_expect	yes
log	"error: a const parameter is `Int` or `UInt`, and `Name` is declared `String`"
log	"  --> examples/const_generic_bad_value_type_error.saw:7:17"
log	"    |"
log	" 7 | struct Labelled<const Name: String> {"
log	"    |                 ^"
log	"   hint: const generics carry integer values in v1 — a parameter of a user type is not supported"
log	""
log	"1 error(s) generated"
